### Input:
Write Python program to print all prime numbers between 1 and 100

### Response:
import math
primes=[]
for i in range (int(math.sqrt(100)),-1,-2):
    for j in primes:
        if i%j==0:
            break
    else:
        primes.append(i)
print('Prime Numbers are',*primes)
